## Description

LongCat-2.0 from @Meituan_LongCat is free in Nous Portal for one week.  It is a 1.6T-parameter MoE with 1M context built for agentic coding, scores 70.8 on Terminal-Bench 2.1, and can ingest an entire codebase in one pass.  Try it out at https://t.co/KCXV2EtbOa https://t.co/M2ZUP3Cs0c

